［建］延"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m034-0035","chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p034","quote":"頃王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m035-0000","chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p035","quote":"頃王"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui","source_id":"s-shiji-052-qidaohui","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p034","quote":"共王八年，徙王淮南。四年，復還王城陽。凡三十三年卒，子［建］延立，是為頃王。","source_term":"子［建］延立"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji052-019","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ABFA"}},{"id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ABFAB","label":"劉福","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"福","mention_ids":["c-shiji-114-dongyue:m009-0170","c-shiji-114-dongyue:m009-0176"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m009-0170","chapter_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:p009","quote":"福"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m009-0176","chapter_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:p009","quote":"福"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue","source_id":"s-shiji114-dongyue","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:p009","quote":"故越衍侯吳陽前在漢，漢使歸諭餘善，餘善弗聽。及橫海將軍先至，越衍侯吳陽以其邑七百人反，攻越軍於漢陽。從建成侯敖，與其率，從繇王居股謀曰：「餘善首惡，劫守吾屬。今漢兵至，眾彊，計殺餘善，自歸諸將，儻幸得脫。」乃遂俱殺餘善，以其眾降橫海將軍，故封繇王居股為東成侯，萬戶；封建成侯敖為開陵侯；封越衍侯吳陽為北石侯；封橫海將軍說為案道侯；封橫海校尉福為繚嫈侯。福者，成陽共王子，故為海常侯，坐法失侯。舊從軍無功，以宗室故侯。諸將皆無成功，莫封。東越將多軍，漢兵至，棄其軍降，封為無錫侯。"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji114-005","interpretation_note":"分支字元不表排行，依明示父系記載接線；未名世代以星號留空。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ABFA"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-052-qidaohui","w