已來王子侯者年表》","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷021&oldid=2607037","quote":"海常。","table_id":"shiji-021","table_cell_id":"shiji-021-t1-r099-c00","scope":"received_parallel_fief_and_parent_identity","image_verified":false},{"title":"《史記·建元已來王子侯者年表》","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷021&oldid=2607037","quote":"城陽共王子。","table_id":"shiji-021","table_cell_id":"shiji-021-t1-r099-c01","scope":"received_parallel_fief_and_parent_identity","image_verified":false},{"title":"《史記·建元已來王子侯者年表》","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷021&oldid=2607037","quote":"三。四年三月乙丑，侯劉福元年。","table_id":"shiji-021","table_cell_id":"shiji-021-t1-r099-c03","scope":"received_parallel_fief_and_parent_identity","image_verified":false}],"rationale":"本篇福之父成陽共王，與王子侯表海常列劉福城陽共王子對讀；齊悼惠世家明記章之子喜是為共王，景紀同一城陽共王卒在中六年。爵國、父子與時序相合暫接喜；成／城原字分存，不用死亡補其他任期，也不把凡三十三年強作城陽連續王期。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"identity_materialized":true}],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:p014","text":"中六年二月己卯，行幸雍，郊見五帝。三月，雨雹。四月，梁孝王、城陽共王、汝南王皆薨。立梁孝王子明為濟川王，子彭離為濟東王，子定為山陽王，子不識為濟陰王。梁分為五。封四侯。更命廷尉為大理，將作少府為將作大匠，主爵中尉為都尉，長信詹事為長信少府，將行為大長秋，大行為行人，奉常為太常，典客為大行，治粟內史為大農。以大內為二千石，置左右內官，屬大內。七月辛亥，日食。八月，匈奴入上郡。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m014-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"五帝","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官稱或未定指代，不補未見姓名與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m014-0026","start":26,"end":29,"surface":"梁孝王","kind":"person","person_id":"m9n_b6v_wo0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m014-0030","start":30,"end":34,"surface":"城陽共王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ABFA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m014-0035","start":35,"end":38,"surface":"汝南王","kind":"person","person_id":"8dd_6r9_hz4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m014-0042","start":42,"end":45,"surface":"梁孝王","kind":"person","person_id":"m9n_b6v_wo0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m014-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"子明","kind":"person","person_id":"m9n_b6v_wo0_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m014-0052","start":52,"end":55,"surface":"子彭離","kind":"person","person_id":"m9n_b6v_wo0_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m014-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"子定","kind":"person","person_id":"m9n_b6v_wo0_C","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m014-0067","start":67,"end":70,"surface":"子不識","kind":"person","person_id":"m9n_b6v_wo0_D","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi","book_id":"b-shiji-011","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-011-jingdi"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p033","text":"城陽景王章，齊悼惠王子，以朱虛侯與大臣共誅諸呂，而章身首先斬相國呂王產於未央宮。孝文帝既立，益封章二千戶，賜金千斤。孝文二年，以齊之城陽郡立章為城陽王。立二年卒，子喜立，是為共王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m033-0000","start":0,"end":5,"surface":"城陽景王章","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ABF","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m033-0006","start":6,"end":10,"surface":"齊悼惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m033-0013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"朱虛侯","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ABF","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m033-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"大臣","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"集體、官稱、未名者或待核回指；不補姓名，王作動詞不當人名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m033-0025","start":25,"end":26,"surface":"章","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ABF","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m033-0030","start":30,"end":35,"surface":"相國呂王產","kind":"person","person_id":"gx0_1xv_0gm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m033-0040","start":40,"end":43,"surface":"孝文帝","kind":"person","person_id":"28d_4fi_xdp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m033-0048","start":48,"end":49,"surface":"章","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ABF","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m033-0058","start":58,"end":60,"surface":"孝文","kind":"person","person_id":"28d_4fi_xdp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m033-0070","start":70,"end":71,"surface":"章","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ABF","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m033-0072","start":72,"end":75,"surface":"城陽王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ABF","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m033-0082","start":82,"end":83,"surface":"喜","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ABFA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m033-0087","start":87,"end":89,"surface":"共王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ABFA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui","book_id":"b-shiji-052","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-052-qidaohui"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p034","text":"共王八年，徙王淮南。四年，復還王城陽。凡三十三年卒，子［建］延立，是為頃王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m034-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"共王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ABFA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m034-0027","start":27,"end":31,"surface":"［建］延","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ABFAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m034-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"頃王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ABFAA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui","book_id":"b-shiji-052","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-052-qidaohui"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:p009","text":"故越衍侯吳陽前在漢，漢使歸諭餘善，餘善弗聽。及橫海將軍先至，越衍侯吳陽以其邑七百人反，攻越軍於漢陽。從建成侯敖，與其率，從繇王居股謀曰：「餘善首惡，劫守吾屬。今漢兵至，眾彊，計殺餘善，自歸諸將，儻幸得脫。」乃遂俱殺餘善，以其眾降橫海將軍，故封繇王居股為東成侯，萬戶；封建成侯敖為開陵侯；封越衍侯吳陽為北石侯；封橫海將軍說為案道侯；封橫海校尉福為繚嫈侯。福者，成陽共王子，故為海常侯，坐法失侯。舊從軍無功，以宗室故侯。諸將皆無成功，莫封。東越將多軍，漢兵至，棄其軍降，封為無錫侯。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m009-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"吳陽","kind":"person","person_id":"bxw_vv0_1t3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m009-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"餘善","kind":"person","person_id":"ub3_zen_skw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m009-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"餘善","kind":"person","person_id":"ub3_zen_skw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m009-0023","start":23,"end":27,"surface":"橫海將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"l9e_fbr_36a_*AB*B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m009-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"吳陽","kind":"person","person_id":"bxw_vv0_1t3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m009-0054","start":54,"end":55,"surface":"敖","kind":"person","person_id":"43i_62q_gf6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m009-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"居股","kind":"person","person_id":"1bh_uew_js1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m009-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"餘善","kind":"person","person_id":"ub3_zen_skw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m009-0089","start":89,"end":91,"surface":"餘善","kind":"person","person_id":"ub3_zen_skw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m009-0107","start":107,"end":109,"surface":"餘善","kind":"person","person_id":"ub3_zen_skw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m009-0114","start":114,"end":118,"surface":"橫海將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"l9e_fbr_36a_*AB*B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m009-0123","start":123,"end"